  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, your grip never leaves the enemy. After landing a successful strike on an enemy, you can attempt to grapple them with advantage. You can use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, regaining all expended uses on a short or long rest.</p>\n<p>In addition, while you are grappling a target, they start their turns taking 1d4 bludgeoning damage.</p>",
